    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d384-a1-a1">

                <pb facs="0732" n="670" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg670"/>

                <head>Second local court of Muzquiz.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Muzquiz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-02-28"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 28,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Let the requirement be complied with, and when this shall have been done, let it
                    be returned. The second local judge, the citizen Victoriano Rodriguez, issued
                    and signed it. We certify.</p>
                <closer><signed>VICTORIANO RODRIGUEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Witnesses:<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian Rios</hi>.<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">M. Guajardo.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
